# Build output: the bundle, the preload, and the smoke captures.
apps/desktop/build/out/
apps/desktop/build/smoke/
# Website screenshots, from `npm run screens`. Ignored for the same reason the
# smoke captures are, and for one more: an app given no file opens the
# operating system's own folders, so a capture can contain whatever is on the
# machine that made it. The generator no longer allows that (build/make-screens.js
# draws its own sample pictures), and this is the second lock on the same door —
# a directory that is not ignored is a directory another session sweeps into a
# commit.
apps/desktop/build/screens/

# Agent scratch and per-machine settings.
.ai/
.vs/
.worktrees/
